title: WishingTree
---
<<declare $wishing_tree_interaction_times = 0>>
<<if $wishing_tree_interaction_times==0>>
 You: There's a wishing tree here.
 You: Want to leave a note?
 -> Yes
  <<WishingSlip WishingSlipUI>>
  You: May the slip find another in another life.
  <<set $wishing_tree_interaction_times = 1>>
 -> No
<<else>>
 You: May the slip find another in another life.
<<endif>>
